Subject: [PATCH -next] powerpc/eeh: Fix debugfs_simple_attr.cocci warnings
Date:   Thu, 20 Dec 2018 02:42:51 +0000
Message-ID: <1545273771-131851-1-git-send-email-yuehaibing@huawei.com>
